## Why This Is Asked
Rationale: tests IPC, process isolation, plugin loading/signing, and hot-swapping in a realistic Android plugin model.

## Key Concepts
- Android IPC via AIDL and bound services
- android:isolatedProcess and per-plugin UIDs
- Dex loading, plugin signing, host verification, and permissions
- Encrypted audit logs per-plugin

