## Why This Is Asked

This tests ability to design a clean data layer for a common feature, and to justify MVVM + repository boundaries.

## Key Concepts

- Room data modeling
- DAO and Repository pattern
- State management in ViewModel
- Jetpack Compose basics
- Basic unit testing with in-memory DB

## Code Example

```kotlin
@Entity(tableName="notes")
data class NoteEntity(
  @PrimaryKey(autoGenerate = true) val id: Long = 0,
  val content: String,
  val timestamp: Long
)

@Dao
interface NoteDao {
  @Insert
  suspend fun insert(note: NoteEntity)
  @Query("SELECT * FROM notes ORDER BY timestamp DESC")
  suspend fun getAll(): List<NoteEntity>
  @Query("SELECT * FROM notes WHERE content LIKE :q ORDER BY timestamp DESC")
  suspend fun search(q: String): List<NoteEntity>
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you handle migrations for NoteEntity schema changes?
- How would you test performance of search queries as the dataset grows?

